===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|en|hunny}} {{q|eye dialect}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|hony|hony, honi}}, from {{inh|en|ang|huniġ}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*hunag}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*hunagą}} (compare {{cog|fy|hunich}}, {{cog|de|Honig}}), from earlier {{m|gem-pro|*hunangą}} (compare {{cog|sv|honung}}), from {{inh|en|ine-pro||*kn̥h₂onk-o-s}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*kn̥h₂ónks}}.

Cognate with {{cog|wlm|canecon||gold}}, {{cog|la|canicae||bran|g=p}}, {{cog|txb|kronkśe||bee}}, {{cog|sq|qengjë||beehive}}, {{cog|grc|κνῆκος||safflower}}, {{cog|kmr|şan||beehive}}, {{cog|lrc|گونج|tr=gonj|t=Bee}}, {{cog|fi|hunaja}}.

