===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|s|pl3qual=archaic|honies}}

# {{lb|en|uncountable}} A [[viscous]], gold-coloured sweet fluid produced from plant [[nectar]] by bees, and often consumed by humans.
#: {{ux|en|The '''honey''' in the pot should last for years.}}
# {{lb|en|countable}} A [[variety]] of this substance.
#* {{quote-journal|en|year=1908|url=http://books.google.com/books?pg=PA40&dq=%22honeys%22&ei=LLDVT-vhL4eq2QWW_tmVDw&id=H507AAAAYAAJ&output=text|passage=The physical properties of the different '''honeys''', color, granulation, aroma, flavor, etc., are indicated in the table only in a very general way.|journal=Bulletin|issue=110-114|author=United States. Bureau of Chemistry}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1949|passage=If two of the California '''honeys''', western hyssop and fleabane, having a positive polarization at 200 C. are disregarded, then the remaining...|url=http://books.google.com/books?id=K84OAAAAQAAJ&pg=PA376&dq=%22honeys%22&hl=en&sa=X&ei=s7DVT8LAMsSe2gXLifGzDw&ved=0CGgQ6AEwBzgK#v=onepage&q=%22honeys%22&f=false|title=The Hive and the Honey Bee|editor=Roy A. Grout}}
#* {{quote-book|en|passage=Eucalyptus '''honeys''' could be characterized based on seven volatile compounds, whereas lavender '''honeys''' had only five...|year=2011|url=http://books.google.com/books?id=znDpyKcvHGUC&pg=PA101&dq=%22honeys%22&hl=en&sa=X&ei=LLDVT-vhL4eq2QWW_tmVDw&ved=0CGUQ6AEwBw#v=onepage&q=%22honeys%22&f=false|title=Advances in Food and Nutrition Research|volume=62|author=Stephen Taylor}}
# {{lb|en|rare}} [[nectar|Nectar]].
# {{lb|en|figuratively}} Something sweet or desirable.
#* {{RQ:Shakespeare Romeo and Juliet|5|3|line=91–93|text=O my love, my wife! / Death, that hath suck'd the '''honey''' of thy breath / Hath had no power yet upon thy beauty.}}
#* {{RQ:Shakespeare Henry 8|III|ii|passage=the '''honey''' of his language}}
# {{n-g|A term of affection.}}
#: {{ux|en|'''Honey''', would you take out the trash?}}
#: {{ux|en|'''Honey''', I'm home.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|date=30 July 2013|author=Dan Shive|title=El Goonish Shive|section=Comic for Tuesday, Jul 30, 2013|sectionurl=https://www.egscomics.com/comic/2013-07-30|format=webcomic|text="So far, so good... are you doing okay?"  "Flying... is ''awesome!''"  "Focus, '''honey'''."}}
# {{lb|en|countable|informal}} A [[woman]], ''especially'' an attractive one.
#: {{ux|en|Man, there are some fine '''honeys''' here tonight!}}
#* {{RQ:Noire Thug-A-Licious|page=130|passage=College was wild. I was like a happy little white kid playing in a sandbox full of toys. '''Honeys''', basketball, music, I indulged in all of that shit to the max. And oh yeah. I went to a couple of classes too. I wasn't totally ass-out stupid.}}
# A spectrum of pale yellow to brownish-yellow colour, like that of most types of (the sweet substance) honey.
#: {{color panel|FDD378}}

